WEBVTT

00:37:58.967 --> 00:38:01.601
There is partnership for AI

00:38:01.625 --> 00:38:06.307
of companies that willingly
self-organize, get together,

00:38:06.331 --> 00:38:08.109
and share best practices.

00:38:08.458 --> 00:38:14.625
And these include things like
how to protect the privacy, security,

00:38:14.649 --> 00:38:17.418
how to deal with data biases,

00:38:17.442 --> 00:38:20.053
and also job displacements.

00:38:20.077 --> 00:38:23.879
So there are various groups
working together on these,

00:38:23.903 --> 00:38:28.029
and I would hope US and China,
as two governments,

00:38:28.053 --> 00:38:32.196
will view the opportunity
to collaborate equally strong.